{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1222962-are-future-nwod-books-going-to-be-integrated-with-new-owod-model-of-publishing","id":1222962,"title":"Are future NWod books going to be integrated with new OWod model of publishing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-29T12:11:40-07:00","id":1222962,"title":"Are future NWod books going to be integrated with new OWod model of publishing?","content":"White Wolf is now part of Paradow, who is now pre-selling Vampire: The Masquerade through Modiphius, who is also doing the design of the books (some very cool photo/art compositions from my humble subjective opinion).<br /> <br /> I wonder if that system of publishing/distribution/design involving a third party publisher is also going to be part of future NWod books or if Onyx Path is in a totally diferent system from the OWod one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T13:36:01-07:00","id":1222988,"title":"","content":"As far as I understand it, Modiphius isn't doing the design of the V5 books, though WW has contracted a specialized company for that as well.<br /> <br /> We haven't heard of any changes intended for the distribution model of the CofD books. Onyx Path already effectively contracts a third party in the form of DriveThruRPG/OneBookShelf to handle digital distribution, and print-on-demand services for their standard books (prestige/deluxe/etc. books that come out of their Kickstarters use a traditional printer, and excess copies that go one sale use Indie Press Revolution).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T13:39:40-07:00","id":1222991,"title":"","content":"Additionally, nuWW is trying to make a big push to get V5 (and possibly the rest of WoD5) into bookstores/FLGS. Conversely, as of right now OPP had not expressed any desire to do the same with CofD.<br /> <br /> Never say never, of course, but right now doesn't seem likely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T15:24:16-07:00","id":1223034,"title":"","content":"Mainly because OPP knows there's literally no market for it. nuWW is misguidedly nostalgic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T15:52:19-07:00","id":1223047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1222962-are-future-nwod-books-going-to-be-integrated-with-new-owod-model-of-publishing?p=1222991#post1222991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Additionally, nuWW is trying to make a big push to get V5 (and possibly the rest of WoD5) into bookstores/FLGS. Conversely, as of right now OPP had not expressed any desire to do the same with CofD.<br /> <br /> Never say never, of course, but right now doesn't seem likely.</div> </div> </div> </div>Our <b>Changeling: The Lost 2nd Edition</b> Kickstarter has this buried in the project page: &quot;We love retailers, but modern publishing methods don\u2019t always make it easy for them to get books into their stores. With <b>CHANGELING: THE LOST</b> 2nd Edition, we want to try to get at least one print run into game stores, so everyone has a chance to experience it.&quot; We figured CtL2 was an excellent candidate to see what the level of interest is from retailers now that we have a great working relationship with Studio2. So, we'll see...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T03:07:32-07:00","id":1223145,"title":"","content":"Testing the waters before committing to a new business practice seems quite reasonable to me. I hope it works even though there's absolutely no store near me that'll get those books. (WotC sells deluxe versions of certain D&amp;D books exclusively in affiliated game/hobby stores. Not a single one is located in Sweden.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T07:34:17-07:00","id":1223906,"title":"","content":"Good luck, I hope the experiment works!<br /> <br /> Would love to be able to get hardcopies of VtR and HtV 2e some day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10328-bkwrm79","name":"bkwrm79","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T09:13:44-07:00","id":1223929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bkwrm79</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1222962-are-future-nwod-books-going-to-be-integrated-with-new-owod-model-of-publishing?p=1223906#post1223906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would love to be able to get hardcopies of VtR and HtV 2e some day.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can order a hardcopy of Vampire: The Requiem's book <a href=\"http://drivethrurpg.com/product/123898/Vampire-The-Requiem-2nd-Edition\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Hunters second edition isn't out yet but it will be on the same site and possibly some others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}